---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Hammer - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Hammer.png" alt="Hammer" /></div>
					<h1>Hammer</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">AR Shredder / Force Multiplier</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+2 STR</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Hammer is a force multiplier. Every strike builds Sunder — denting armor, cracking carapace, and making the whole party more dangerous. Sunder accumulation makes your own attacks more accurate while opening called shot windows for allies. At full stacks, monsters take your riders at disadvantage and your techniques can tear AR off a target permanently. The Stun exists — but it's earned through the system, not given for free.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Heavy</li>
									<li>Two-Handed</li>
									<li>Blunt</li>
									<li>Commitment (some moves)</li>
									<li>Wind-Up (some moves)</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Save DC</h3>
								<p class="formula">10 + STR mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Special</h3>
								<p>Reach: 5 ft. No Parry. No Guard.</p>
								<p>The Hammer commits fully to offense — no defensive reactions available.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Sunder</h2>
						<p>Your blows dent armor and crack carapace. Each hit makes the next one more likely — and eventually, the whole party benefits from what you've broken open.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>Sunder Rules (per target, cap 3)</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Build Sunder:</strong> Each Hammer hit on a target applies <strong>+1 Sunder</strong> to that target (max 3).</li>
								<li><strong>Accuracy bonus:</strong> Your Hammer attacks against that target gain <strong>+X to hit</strong>, where X equals its current Sunder count.</li>
								<li><strong>Shove rider:</strong> After any Hammer hit vs a target with Sunder ≥ 1, you may immediately attempt to Shove it — target makes a STR save vs your Hammer DC; on fail, pushed 5 ft. <strong>Once per turn.</strong></li>
								<li><strong>Sunder 3:</strong> The target makes CON and STR saves against your Hammer riders at <strong>disadvantage</strong>.</li>
							</ul>
							<p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><em>Whiffs matter: missing attacks stalls Sunder accumulation. Consistency is the engine.</em></p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Damage Dice</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d12 + STR</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>2d8 + STR</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d10 + STR</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>3d8 + STR</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d10 + STR</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Cratering Blow</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action • Commitment</div>
							</div>
							<p>Bring the head down like a meteor. One hit does the work of two.</p>
							<p><strong>On hit:</strong> Deal weapon damage and apply <strong>+1 extra Sunder</strong> (usually 2 total from this single hit).</p>
							<p><strong>Rider:</strong> Target makes a <strong>CON save vs your Hammer DC</strong>. On fail: <strong>Dazed</strong> for 1 turn.</p>
							<p><em>At Sunder 3 the save is made at disadvantage — Cratering Blow into a built target is a reliable Daze.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Armor Breaker</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">3 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Pick a seam and explode it. Cash your Sunder stacks for burst or open a window for the party.</p>
							<p><strong>On hit, choose one:</strong></p>
							<div class="choice-block">
								<div class="choice">
									<div class="choice-label">Plateburst</div>
									<p>Consume all Sunder stacks. Add <strong>+1 Power Die per stack consumed</strong> to this hit's damage (max +3 Power Dice).</p>
								</div>
								<div class="choice">
									<div class="choice-label">Shatter Window</div>
									<p>Consume all Sunder stacks. That <strong>specific part suffers AR −2</strong> until the start of your next turn — party-wide vs that part. Sunder returns to 0 after.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
							<p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><em>Plateburst is your personal damage spike. Shatter Window is the team's called shot window.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Aftershock</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>Your impacts ripple through bone and steel. The more you've built, the harder every hit lands.</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Your Hammer attacks deal <strong>+X bonus damage</strong> where X equals the target's current Sunder count.</li>
								<li>After any Hammer hit, your <strong>Shove attempt is at advantage</strong>.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><em>At Sunder 3 this is +3 flat damage on every hit — passive and stackable with Armor Breaker.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Seismic Slam</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">3 Stamina • Action • Commitment • AoE</div>
							</div>
							<p>Drive the Hammer into the ground and send a brutal shock ring through everything nearby.</p>
							<p><strong>Primary hit:</strong> Make a melee attack vs one target. On hit: deal weapon damage + <strong>+2 Power Dice</strong>.</p>
							<p><strong>Shock ring:</strong> All creatures within <strong>10 ft of the impact point</strong> make a DEX save vs your Hammer DC. Fail: knocked <strong>Prone</strong>. (No damage from the ring — just the knockdown.)</p>
							<p><strong>Sunder 3 trigger:</strong> If the primary target had Sunder 3 when you hit, it must also make a <strong>CON save</strong> (at disadvantage). Fail: <strong>Stunned</strong> for 1 turn.</p>
							<p><em>This is the primary Stun delivery. Sunder 3 + Seismic Slam is the setup the weapon is built around.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Shatterfall</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">4 Stamina • Wind-Up • Commitment • Rooting</div>
							</div>
							<p>An all-or-nothing plate-breaker. Skip a turn to end a fight.</p>
							<p><strong>Wind-Up:</strong> Skip your Action this turn. You are Rooted — you cannot move or be moved voluntarily. If interrupted (knocked Prone, Stunned, or forced to move) before the Execution, the technique fails with no Stamina refund.</p>
							<p><strong>Execution (your next turn, Action):</strong> Make one Hammer attack with <strong>advantage</strong>. On hit:</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Deal <strong>(weapon damage + STR modifier) × 2</strong>.</li>
								<li><strong>Auto-Sunder:</strong> Set the target to Sunder 3 instantly (before riders resolve).</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Break check:</strong> Target makes a CON save vs your Hammer DC at <strong>disadvantage</strong> (from Sunder 3).</p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Fail:</strong> <strong>Stunned</strong> for 1 turn and suffers <strong>Shattered Armor</strong> (AR −2 vs all sources) for the rest of the hunt.</li>
								<li><strong>Success:</strong> <strong>Staggered</strong> and AR −1 for 3 rounds.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Best-in-class AR shred — Shatter Window and Shatterfall open the monster for the whole party</li>
									<li>Sunder accuracy scaling means you get harder to miss as the fight goes on</li>
									<li>Reliable knockdowns and Daze, with Stun earned at Sunder 3 via Seismic Slam</li>
									<li>Scales into long fights: Aftershock passive damage grows with Sunder maintenance</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>No Parry, no Guard — fully exposed to counterattacks, no defensive options</li>
									<li>Commitment and Wind-Up windows are punishable; displacement ruins your setup</li>
									<li>Short reach — needs smart positioning or support to stay on target</li>
									<li>Whiffs stall Sunder and decay momentum; consistency is the whole engine</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.mechanic-details p { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.mechanic-details ul { margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.mechanic-details li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
			.choice-block { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
			.choice { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.choice-label { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.choice p { margin-bottom: 0; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
				.choice-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
